            <tr><th scope="row">1958</th> <td>Wassaw Sound, off Tybee Island, Georgia</td> <td>A Mark 15 bomb, without its core by the Air Force’s account, jettisoned after a mid-air collision. Declared “irretrievably lost.”<sup><a href="#note-1">1</a>, <a href="#note-10">10</a></sup></td></tr>
