      <p class="fig"><strong>A note on this edition.</strong> Where sources disagree, this page uses the one written at the time and names the other in its note. Several widely repeated figures were left out because they could not be traced to a source, among them the claim that five of six safeguards failed at Goldsboro. The research behind every line is kept with the site’s source. The same public-domain terms as the site.</p>

